# Test: spki-pin creates a valid pin dict with Sha256 algorithm and bytes fingerprint
# Expected: dict with algorithm and fingerprint fields
[include %libdir "net.llt"]

[Sha256: [variant "Sha256"]]
[pin: [spki-pin Sha256 [bytes-of [65 66 67]]]]
[
  algorithm: [tag-of pin.algorithm]
  fingerprint: [bytes? pin.fingerprint]
]

=== error
[E022] unexpected named argument: algorithm (valid parameter names: xs) (defined at 100:5-100:59)
  in [set ...] at 100:5-100:59
  in [set ...] at 100:5-100:59
  in materialized at 5:1-5:47

=== warn
undefined variable: spki-pin at 5:8-5:16
expected record type, got <error> at 7:22-7:35
expected record type, got <error> at 8:24-8:39
